-- title:
--   Determinant of x ↦ Aσ(x)-Bx on L⊗_K Kᵥ
-- statement:
--   Let $K$ and $L$ be number fields with $L$ an extension of $K$ that is Galois, let $\sigma$ be a $K$-algebra automorphism of $L$ such that every $\tau \in \mathrm{Gal}(L/K)$ lies in the subgroup of integer powers of $\sigma$ (so the Galois group is cyclic, generated by $\sigma$), let $v$ be a height-one prime of the ring of integers $\mathcal{O}_K$, and write $K_v$ for the $v$-adic completion of $K$ and $E = L \otimes_K K_v$. Let $A, B$ be units of the ring $E$. The assertion is that there exists a $K_v$-linear endomorphism $T$ of $E$ such that, for every $x \in E$, $T(x) = A \cdot \sigma_E(x) - B \cdot x$, where $\sigma_E$ denotes [`AutomorphicForm.sigmaTensor`](def/AutomorphicForm_TwistedOrbital.html#L199) for $\sigma$, that is the ring endomorphism of $E$ obtained from $\sigma \otimes \mathrm{id}_{K_v}$, and such that the determinant of $T$ as a $K_v$-linear map satisfies $$\det T = (-1)^{\,[L:K]}\bigl(N_{E/K_v}(B) - N_{E/K_v}(A)\bigr),$$ with $[L:K]$ the $K$-rank of $L$ and $N_{E/K_v}$ the algebra norm of $E$ over $K_v$ applied to the underlying elements of the units $A$ and $B$.
--
--   This is the Jacobian computation underlying the unfolding of twisted orbital integrals for a cyclic extension: the $\sigma$-twisted map $x \mapsto A\sigma(x) - Bx$ on $L \otimes_K K_v$ has determinant $\pm(N(B) - N(A))$, reflecting that the characteristic polynomial of multiplication-by-$c$ composed with $\sigma$ is $X^{[L:K]} - N(c)$. It feeds the estimate [`AutomorphicForm.exists_forall_norm_sub_norm_mul_le_mul_rpow_mul_log_pow_of_isTwistedOrbitalIntegral_indicator_semiLocalIntegralSet_mul_mul`](thm.html#AutomorphicForm.exists_forall_norm_sub_norm_mul_le_mul_rpow_mul_log_pow_of_isTwistedOrbitalIntegral_indicator_semiLocalIntegralSet_mul_mul), where the resulting factor $|N(A)-N(B)|_v$ cancels the discriminant prefactor; the proof uses the expression of the norm on $L \otimes_K E$ as the product over $\mathrm{Gal}(L/K)$ of the conjugation maps.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_AutomorphicForm_exists_linearMap_mul_sigmaTensor_sub_mul_and_det_eq_neg_one_pow_mul_norm_sub_norm.lean

